decision review-remanded: "Further review ruling (remanded)" by court cite ?("Fed. R. Bankr. P. 8006 (verify)")
{
  note "OUTLINE. Appeal to court of appeals under 28 U.S.C. 158(d)(1) (verify)."
  edge-review-remanded-remanded-final "Review denied" -> remanded-final {
